# Files that run inside the Linux containers must keep Unix line endings, even when the repository
# is checked out on Windows (core.autocrlf would otherwise turn them into CRLF and break them).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
